{"type":"message","id":"d02f2fbb","parentId":"d7782d78","timestamp":"2026-04-08T04:31:41.245Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户询问\"添加agent的完整命令是什么\"。这看起来是在问如何在OpenClaw中添加或配置一个agent。\n\n让我检查一下用户可能在问什么：\n1. 添加一个新的agent到OpenClaw配置中？\n2. 创建一个新的sub-agent会话？\n3. 使用某种特定的agent工具？\n\n根据上下文，用户似乎是在询问如何添加/配置agent。我应该检查OpenClaw的配置方式。\n\n让我先查看一下是否有相关的配置信息或者帮助文档。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"添加 agent 的完整命令取决于你想做什么：\n\n## 1. 添加 OpenClaw 官方 Agent（ACP 模式）\n```bash\nopenclaw agents add <agent-id>\n```\n例如：\n```bash\nopenclaw agents add codex\nopenclaw agents add claude-code\n```\n\n## 2. 创建 Sub-Agent 会话（临时任务）\n```bash\nopenclaw session spawn --task \"你的任务描述\"\n```\n\n## 3. 手动配置 Agent\n编辑 `~/.openclaw/config.json` 或 `openclaw.json`：\n```json\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"my-agent\": {\n      \"command\": \"/path/to/agent\",\n      \"args\": [\"--some-flag\"],\n      \"env\": { \"KEY\": \"value\" }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**你想添加哪种类型的 agent？** 告诉我具体场景，我可以给你更精确的命令。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775622681839,"responseId":"0217756226829445f604284f1308ec1179c896be0e061f8fe6c0d"}}
