{"type":"message","id":"c73261b9","parentId":"edc2d2e4","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:53:52.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"系统当前是 UTC 时区，用户希望改为上海时区 (Asia/Shanghai)。\n\n由于这是容器环境，`timedatectl` 不可用，而且修改系统时区需要 root 权限。但我可以：\n\n1. 设置环境变量 `TZ=Asia/Shanghai`\n2. 或者在 OpenClaw 配置中记录用户的时区偏好\n\n让我先检查 OpenClaw 的配置文件位置，看看能否在配置中设置时区。由于 `openclaw config set timezone` 失败了，说明 \"timezone\" 不是一个有效的配置键。\n\n我应该：\n1. 尝试通过环境变量设置\n2. 或者帮用户创建一个 wrapper 脚本\n3. 或者记录在 USER.md 中\n\n让我给用户一个实际的解决方案。由于我无法直接修改系统时区（容器限制），我应该提供替代方案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"当前系统运行在 UTC 时区，且由于是容器环境，无法直接修改系统时区（没有 `timedatectl` 权限）。\n\n以下是几种解决方案：\n\n## 方案 1：设置环境变量（当前会话有效）\n```bash\nexport TZ=Asia/Shanghai\ndate  # 验证时间\n```\n\n## 方案 2：永久生效（添加到 shell 配置）\n```bash\necho 'export TZ=Asia/Shanghai' >> ~/.bashrc\nsource ~/.bashrc\n```\n\n## 方案 3：OpenClaw 配置时区（如果支持）\n让我检查一下配置格式："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:22","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw config list 2>/dev/null || cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json 2>/dev/null || echo \"Config file not found\"","pty":false}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775642009188,"responseId":"0217756420093598a2cc6176b4dc89676d1081d755bfbd1becc3d"}}
