{"type":"message","id":"d77247a6","parentId":"722aeaf3","timestamp":"2026-04-08T09:54:20.843Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"由于这是容器环境，我无法直接修改系统时区。让我给你提供几个实用的解决方案。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"由于这是容器环境，没有 `timedatectl` 权限，以下是几种设置上海时区的方案：\n\n## 方案 1：环境变量（推荐，立即生效）\n```bash\nexport TZ=Asia/Shanghai\ndate  # 验证：现在应该显示 CST 时间\n```\n\n## 方案 2：永久生效（写入 shell 配置）\n```bash\necho 'export TZ=Asia/Shanghai' >> ~/.bashrc\nsource ~/.bashrc\ndate  # 验证\n```\n\n## 方案 3：OpenClaw 配置时区（如果支持）\n让我检查配置文件中是否有时区选项：\n\n从配置文件中看，OpenClaw 配置目前没有直接的 `timezone` 字段。时区设置主要通过系统环境变量控制。\n\n---\n\n**验证时区是否生效：**\n```bash\ndate +\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S %Z\"\n# 正常输出类似：2026-04-08 17:53:29 CST\n```\n\n你想让我帮你执行哪个方案？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775642035957,"responseId":"0217756420360578a2cc6176b4dc89676d1081d755bfbd1951929"}}
