r reminders. Keep it small to limit token burn.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:**Use heartbeat when:**\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:- Multiple checks can batch together (inbox + calendar + notifications in one turn)\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:- You want to reduce API calls by combining periodic checks\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:**Tip:** Batch similar periodic checks into `HEARTBEAT.md` instead of creating multiple cron jobs. Use cron for precise schedules and standalone tasks."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":41,"aggregated":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/HEARTBEAT.md:# Keep this file empty (or with only comments) to skip heartbeat API calls.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/HEARTBEAT.md:# Add tasks below when you want the agent to check something periodically.\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:│   • ECHO 资产         │    │   • 监听 ECHO 事件                │\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:EventWatcher（事件监听器）\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:├── 监听 NewRental → 授权用户 + 激活 Skill 会话\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:├── 监听 UserAuthorized → 给指定用户开通使用权限\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:├── 监听 PermissionApproved → 允许场景合约调用\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:├── 监听 DerivativeApproved → 建立父子 Skill 关系\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:└── 监听 DerivTermsUpdated → 更新分润规则\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:Bridge 监听 EchoRented → 写入 ActivePermissions\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/echoagent_design.md:2. EchoAgent Bridge（单节点版本）\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:- Search the web, check calendars\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/AGENTS.md:Skills provide your tools. When you need one, check its `SKILL.md`. Keep local notes (camera names, SSH details, voice 