{"type":"message","id":"2f98e3a8","parentId":"c81d35b4","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:32:05.325Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户提到了 `auth-profiles.json` 这个文件，询问是否每个 agent 都应该复制一份。\n\n这个文件通常存储了认证的 profile 信息，比如 API keys、tokens 等。\n\n根据 OpenClaw 的架构：\n- 通常 `auth-profiles.json` 是全局配置，放在 `~/.openclaw/` 目录下\n- 所有 agents 共享同一个 gateway 和配置\n- 不需要每个 agent 都复制一份\n\n但是也要看具体情况：\n1. 如果每个 agent 使用不同的认证信息（比如不同的 API key），可能需要分开\n2. 如果所有 agent 使用相同的认证，共享一份即可\n\n让我查看一下当前的配置情况。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好问题！让我先查看一下当前的配置情况："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:42","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find ~/.openclaw -name \"auth-profiles.json\" 2>/dev/null","pty":false}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:43","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/.openclaw/agents/*/ 2>/dev/null | head -30","pty":false}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec:44","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclau/config.json 2>/dev/null | grep -A 20 '\"auth\"' || echo \"Checking openclaw.json auth section\"","pty":false}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775669510158,"responseId":"0217756695104561c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3ac318dc3"}}
