{"type":"message","id":"7d7f7de3","parentId":"abf67b6d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:36:53.308Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b525d6c2170a0ee8ece8ffb182ac\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-04-08 17:36 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b525d6c2170a0ee8ece8ffb182ac]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 为何你这里显示unknown\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.4.8\n🧠 Model: volcengine-plan/kimi-k2.5 · 🔑 unknown"}],"timestamp":1775669813304}}
{"type":"message","id":"f533b845","parentId":"7d7f7de3","timestamp":"2026-04-08T17:37:06.308Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问的是为什么我显示的版本信息里有 \"unknown\"。从之前的输出来看：\n\n```\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.4.1 (unknown) — Built by lobsters, for humans. Don't question the hierarchy.\n```\n\n还有现在显示的是：\n```\n🦞 OpenClaw 2026.4.8\n🧠 Model: volcengine-plan/kimi-k2.5 · 🔑 unknown\n```\n\n这里的 \"unknown\" 通常指的是：\n1. OpenClaw 构建版本信息未知（可能从源码构建或CI构建时没有正确设置版本信息）\n2. API Key 的归属/名称未知\n\n我应该解释这是什么意思，以及是否需要关心这个问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这里的 **\"unknown\"** 指的是 **OpenClaw 的构建版本标识** 和 **API Key 的归属信息** 未识别。\n\n## 这是什么意思？\n\n1. **OpenClaw 2026.4.8 (unknown)**\n   - 版本号是 `2026.4.8`\n   - `(unknown)` 表示这是从源码构建的，或者是 CI 构建时没有正确打上 git commit 标识\n   - **不影响使用**，只是版本追踪信息\n\n2. **🔑 unknown** (在 Model 后面)\n   - 表示当前使用的 API Key（Volcengine Plan）没有设置别名/名称\n   - 在 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 的 `auth.profiles` 里可以给 key 加 `name` 字段\n\n## 需要修复吗？\n\n**不需要。** 这是 cosmetic（外观）问题，不影响功能。如果你在意，可以：\n\n```bash\n# 给 API Key 加个别名\nopenclaw config set auth.profiles.volcengine-plan:default.name \"My Volc Key\"\n```\n\n但完全 optional。你的 OpenClaw 运行正常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"kimi-k2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775669813308,"responseId":"0217756698133991c239b210ad979e2a15a147bceeac3acf58466"}}
