{"type":"message","id":"ed86c44d","parentId":"f6638ad7","timestamp":"2026-04-09T02:34:28.839Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The cron job \"节点异常检测\" timed out. The script has a timeout of 10 seconds for the HTTPS request, and the cron job itself has a timeout of 30 seconds. The script execution exited with code 1, which means it failed.\n\nLooking at the script output:\n```\n(Command exited with code 1)\n```\n\nThis could mean:\n1. The API request to `node.meerfans.club` timed out or failed\n2. There was an error parsing the response\n3. The script threw an error\n\nThe cron job timeout is set to 30 seconds, but the script might be taking longer due to:\n1. Network issues connecting to `node.meerfans.club`\n2. The API not responding within the 10 second timeout in the script\n3. Some other issue\n\nI should help the user by:\n1. Explaining why it might have timed out\n2. Suggesting solutions like increasing the timeout or fixing the network issue\n3. Maybe testing the script manually to see what happens\n\nLet me suggest increasing the timeout for the cron job and also checking if the API is accessible.","thinkingSignature":"303d1c94c1ca0b98a966de4eed27e3c3c1ffd144a55abd79a60a07e99c5be25e"},{"type":"text","text":"节点监控脚本执行超时了（exit code 1）。\n\n**可能原因：**\n1. API `node.meerfans.club` 响应慢或不可达\n2. 脚本内的 10 秒请求超时太短\n3. Cron job 的 30 秒执行超时也不够\n\n让我测试一下这个 API 是否正常：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8rfog4rm3685_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s --connect-timeout 5 -m 15 https://node.meerfans.club/api/status 2>&1 | head -50","pty":false}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":46,"output":368,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":35554,"totalTokens":35968,"cost":{"input":0.0000138,"output":0.0004416,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.01333275,"total":0.01378815}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775702048349,"responseId":"06264321fce25c9f6212f6b351d3b05f"}}
