{"type":"message","id":"b8ffe257","parentId":"143bf90d","timestamp":"2026-04-09T02:36:50.569Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The openclaw-gateway process is running. Let me try to run the cron edit command again, maybe with a simpler format. Or maybe I should suggest the user run the command themselves directly on the machine since my exec tool seems to be having issues with the openclaw CLI commands.Actually, looking at the situation:\n1. The script runs fine manually\n2. The cron job times out with 30 seconds\n3. The openclaw CLI commands seem to hang\n\nThe simplest solution is to increase the cron timeout. Let me try one more approach - maybe using `openclaw cron edit` with a shorter output or something.Actually, let me just provide the command for the user to run themselves, since the exec tool seems to be having issues with the openclaw CLI.","thinkingSignature":"0b9b8e9955882ab307f3167602850a3aee36ad80baf7b224b2637b9a9cba604f"},{"type":"text","text":"openclaw CLI 命令似乎挂起了。脚本本身运行正常（2秒完成），问题应该是 cron job 的 30 秒 timeout 不够（加上 isolated session 启动的开销）。\n\n**请你手动运行这个命令：**\n\n```bash\nopenclaw cron edit 2af4bbbc-7d03-40b5-87a3-03e3be36acb7 --timeout-seconds 60\n```\n\n或者，如果你想直接查看/编辑 cron 配置：\n\n```bash\nopenclaw cron list\n```\n\n---\n\n**问题原因分析：**\n- 脚本本身执行很快（~2秒）\n- 但 cron job 启动 isolated session 需要额外时间\n- 30 秒 timeout 可能刚好不够\n\n**临时解决方案：**\n1. 运行上面的命令增加 timeout 到 60 秒\n2. 或者手动跑一次脚本测试：\n   ```bash\n   node /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/scripts/node-monitor.js\n   ```\n\n你先跑一下那个 edit 命令看看能否成功？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":27027,"output":366,"cacheRead":12524,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39917,"cost":{"input":0.0081081,"output":0.0004392,"cacheRead":0.0007514399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00929874}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775702196288,"responseId":"062643b422d0144ad49745cce70147ba"}}
