{"type":"message","id":"0736d6b0","parentId":"e4150a0d","timestamp":"2026-04-09T03:41:23.263Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System (untrusted): [2026-04-09 02:35:17 UTC] Exec failed (dawn-gla, signal SIGTERM) :: ry\": { \"mode\": \"announce\", \"channel\": \"feishu\", \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"accountId\": \"lucus\" }, \"state\": { \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775707861786, \"lastRunAtMs\": 1…\nSystem (untrusted): [2026-04-09 02:35:42 UTC] Exec failed (clear-ke, signal SIGTERM) :: 🦞 OpenClaw 2026.4.8 (unknown) — I'll do the boring stuff while you dramatically stare at the logs like it's cinema. Usage: openclaw cron [options] Manage cron jobs via the Gatewa…\nSystem (untrusted): [2026-04-09 02:35:58 UTC] Exec failed (grand-pi, signal SIGTERM)\nSystem (untrusted): [2026-04-09 02:36:34 UTC] Exec failed (kind-riv, signal SIGTERM)\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5245b3017868ee74c0eb870221d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-04-09 03:41 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5245b3017868ee74c0eb870221d]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 已编辑成功。另外帮我分析一下为何每次登录mac的taiscalse，名字和ip都变了，能否固定\nblocklee@Mac ~ % tailscale status\n100.96.203.30  blockmacbook-pro-5  lucifer.block121@  macOS  -                                                        \n100.71.164.94  blockmacbook-pro-1  lucifer.block121@  macOS  offline, last seen 1d ago                                \n100.73.255.73  blockmacbook-pro-2  lucifer.block121@  macOS  offline, last seen 1d ago                                \n100.73.38.40   blockmacbook-pro-3  lucifer.block121@  macOS  offline, last seen 1d ago                                \n100.71.87.47   blockmacbook-pro-4  lucifer.block121@  macOS  offline, last seen 11h ago                               \n100.105.61.78  blockmacbook-pro    lucifer.block121@  macOS  offline, last seen 2d ago"}],"timestamp":1775706083260}}
{"type":"message","id":"ba0df259","parentId":"0736d6b0","timestamp":"2026-04-09T03:41:56.388Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问的是关于 Tailscale 的问题。从输出来看，用户的 Mac 有多个设备条目，名字都是 blockmacbook-pro 但后面有不同的数字后缀（-1, -2, -3, -4, -5），而且有不同的 IP 地址（100.96.203.30, 100.71.164.94, 100.73.255.73, 100.71.87.47, 100.105.61.78）。\n\n问题原因：\n1. 每次用户重新连接 Tailscale，设备可能获得不同的 IP\n2. 设备名后面有数字后缀，可能是因为同一账户多次登录或 DNS 名字冲突\n\n用户想固定设备名和 IP 地址。这需要：\n1. 在 Tailscale 管理后台设置设备别名/固定名字\n2. 或者使用 Tailscale 的 --owner flag\n3. 或者在 Tailscale 的配置文件里设置 IP 地址分配策略\n\n这是一个关于 Tailscale 配置的问题，不是 OpenClaw 相关的问题。","thinkingSignature":"66aa195767777f3d9fbabefc8bc001961973794d23748506847a7bd2c409c49d"},{"type":"text","text":"这个问题是 Tailscale 的，不是 OpenClaw。\n\n## 原因分析\n\n你的 Mac 有多个 `blockmacbook-pro-*` 条目，说明**每次重新登录 Tailscale 时被当作新设备注册**了。可能原因：\n\n1. **多设备/多端登录** - 同一个 Tailscale 账户从不同位置/接口登录\n2. **设备名冲突** - Tailscale 自动添加数字后缀区分同名设备\n3. **IP 分配策略** - 默认用 ephemeral（临时）IP 地址\n\n## 解决方案\n\n### 1. 固定设备名（推荐）\n在 Tailscale 管理后台（admin console）设置：\n- 找到你的设备，编辑 `Device name` 为固定名称如 `blockmacbook-pro`\n- 勾选 `Static IP` 获取固定 IP\n\n### 2. 使用固定 IP（需要 Tailscale 付费版或有 Taildrop）\n```bash\n# 在你的 Mac 上运行\ntailscale set --hostname blockmacbook-pro\ntailscale set --alias \"我的 Mac\"\n```\n\n### 3. 检查是否为同一设备重复登录\n```bash\ntailscale status | grep -i macbook\n```\n看看是否有多于 1-2 个在线的设备。\n\n### 4. 合并设备条目\n如果确实是同一台 Mac，在 Tailscale admin console 中：\n- 删除多余的旧设备条目\n- 保留最新的那个，标记为 `blockmacbook-pro`\n\n---\n\n**你的问题是同一台 Mac 被注册了 6 个不同名字的设备**，最简单的方式是登录 [Tailscale Admin Console](https://login.tailscale.com/admin/devices) 清理旧条目，然后给剩下的设个固定名字。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":46,"output":566,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":39557,"totalTokens":40169,"cost":{"input":0.0000138,"output":0.0006791999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.014833875,"total":0.015526874999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775706083264,"responseId":"062652e3698c4670ab0df040dee65141"}}
